{"id":"bonheur","lemma":"bonheur","pos":"noun","rank":987,"glosses":["goodhap, good fortune","happiness"],"ipa":"/bɔ.nœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/Fr-bonheur.ogg/Fr-bonheur.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bonheurs"},"formAudio":{"bonheurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-bonheurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu es mon porte-bonheur.","en":"You're my good luck charm.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"Qu'est-ce que le bonheur ?","en":"What is happiness?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]},{"text":"Voilà le secret du véritable bonheur.","en":"This is the secret of true happiness.","words":[{"g":"there is, there comes"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"secret"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"veritable"},null]},{"text":"Je te souhaite du bonheur.","en":"I wish you happiness.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to wish","l":"souhaiter"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Le plus grand des bonheurs c'est la liberté.","en":"The greatest happiness lies in freedom.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"big"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"freedom, liberty"}]}]}